  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund for Achieving Nutrition Impact at Scale Parallel Trust Fund of TF072405</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Trust Fund is to accelerate the scale-up of investments in nutrition programs in selected countries to effectively deliver evidence-based interventions leading ultimately to reductions in the prevalence of child stunting and other forms of undernutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
